{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27305","headline":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 七 · 裴潾","name":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南溪回舟，西岭望竦。\n水远如空，山微似𡾩\n二室峯连，四山骈耸。\n五女乍欹，玉华独踊。\n云翔日耀，如戴如拱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴潾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}